Hi,

I am trying to run the same on a different data set with 13 variables. I would post the result.
Just for now I have a question like predicting using the coefficient learned using the algorithm.

Without rmr I did the following:
trainset <- data.frame(read.csv("train.
csv"))
model.lg <- glm(y ~ x1+x2+x3+x4+x5+x6+x7+x8+x9+x10+x11+x12+x13, family=binomial, data=trainset) // For testing working without the bias term.
testset <- data.frame(read.csv("test.csv"))
answer = predict(model.lg, testset, type="response")
write.csv(answer, file="predict.csv")

It worked perfectly fine.

Now what I did for rmr is as follows.

traindata =
    to.dfs(
      as.matrix(
